WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.10 · Internal Systems & Operations
Issues, actions and decisions tracking

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Track issues, actions and decisions in one place from the start, so patterns become visible.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:28.874
An issue is something that has already happened and needs a response: a complaint, a missed deadline, a broken tool. A risk is something that might happen. Tracking issues, actions and decisions in one place makes patterns visible.

4
00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:29.874
Three things to track

5
00:00:29.874 --> 00:00:42.685
Issues: What happened, who is affected, how serious it is, who owns the response, when resolved. For example: The bakery's oven breaks before a big order; the log names who calls the repairer.

6
00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:54.385
Actions: Every action from a meeting has one owner and a due date. For example: Bakery meeting: “Ask the market for a better stall spot”, owner sales founder, due Friday.

7
00:00:54.385 --> 00:01:08.026
Decisions: Each decision recorded with its reason, so people who join later understand it. For example: The bakery logs why shifts start at 7 am: the kitchen is free and buses run.

8
00:01:08.426 --> 00:01:09.026
Why track them

9
00:01:09.026 --> 00:01:14.700
1. Patterns appear: the same problem three times is a system problem.

10
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:19.263
2. Nothing fades away without being closed on purpose.

11
00:01:19.263 --> 00:01:25.196
3. An honest record helps you learn as you grow.

12
00:01:25.596 --> 00:01:26.196
What it connects to

13
00:01:26.196 --> 00:01:32.241
1. Your risk list in Module 10: note when a risk has happened.

14
00:01:32.241 --> 00:01:37.544
2. Your weekly or monthly routine: review and close open items.

15
00:01:37.544 --> 00:01:44.219
3. Your decision log from Module 3, kept in the same place.

16
00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:45.219
What to avoid

17
00:01:45.219 --> 00:01:49.781
Keeping issues in people's heads or scattered chats.

18
00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:53.974
Actions with no owner or no date.

19
00:01:53.974 --> 00:02:01.019
Putting safeguarding details in the shared log instead of their confidential route.

20
00:02:01.619 --> 00:02:03.419
You set up your issue and action tracking routine.

21
00:02:03.419 --> 00:02:07.419
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

22
00:02:08.919 --> 00:02:12.019
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
